'''Type of Feat''': [[General]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[Dex]] 13, [[Point Blank Shot]]

'''Specifics''': You may spend a [[round]] to aim a target, and receive a +2 to [[attack roll]] the next round. You may aim for up to 3 consecutive rounds, gaining a maximum of +6, but you only make a single attack.

'''Use''': Selected.

